Governor, 05:50Z. I removed this row's dependsOn edge to ab323f85 so an idle worker can start now; the board had 4 idle workers and one active row. This row edits only moe-vscode/** and tests against fake bundled wrappers, so it needs no wrapper bytes. Code to the wrapper contract the plans state, as d609eae3 does:
- `copilot` is accepted under the protected runtime;
- the headless override for copilot is the generic `-Interactive:$false` / `--no-interactive`;
- there is no -CopilotExec.
If ab323f85 lands a different contract, the landed one wins, and QA checks this row against it. The docs row 1c580985 still waits on this row and on d609eae3.
